        "description": "A silver festival costume for women drawn to cosmic and cyberpunk fashion, with a sci-fi mood for rave nights and photoshoots.<br><br>About the design<br>Round chest panels and sweeping curves give the design a distinctly space-age character. Open areas around the waist and hip contrast with the broad silver panels. This metallic festival outfit has a smooth, glossy surface with a polished metal-inspired finish. Visible buckle straps add a utilitarian detail to the otherwise rounded design.<br><br>Choose exactly what you want to purchase<br>Select one configuration: Garters, Panties, Skirt, Top, Top + Skirt, or Full Set. The price shown for your selected configuration is the total price of that option. Pieces not included in the selected configuration are not included in your order.<br><br>Available colorways<br>Gold or Silver. Both choices are offered at the same price for a given configuration.<br><br>Materials<br>Handmade using vegan leather with a metallic reflective finish. Material is not a separate purchasing option for this product.<br><br>Who it is for<br>Women choosing a cosmic look for a music festival.<br>Rave-goers choosing cyberpunk clothing for a night of electronic music.<br>Photographers planning a sci-fi fashion shoot with a female model.<br>Costume stylists creating a futuristic look for a desert photoshoot.<br><br>Made to order. If you need sizing details, please contact the seller before purchasing.",
